WEBVTT

00:11:30.916 --> 00:11:33.236
And then, all of a sudden, you did.

00:11:34.356 --> 00:11:38.836
That's what's happening right now
in global environmental microbiology.

00:11:38.836 --> 00:11:41.556
And so we should expect this revolution

00:11:41.596 --> 00:11:44.076
in our understanding
of these microscopic organisms,

00:11:44.116 --> 00:11:46.156
and particularly fungi,

00:11:46.196 --> 00:11:50.436
to transform how we understand
and how we manage our ecosystems

00:11:50.476 --> 00:11:52.156
in a foundational way.

00:11:53.236 --> 00:11:54.396
Thank you.

00:11:54.436 --> 00:11:59.116
(Cheers and applause)